<title>USA: MEDIQ unit gets $260 mln credit agreement.</title>
<headline>MEDIQ unit gets $260 mln credit agreement.</headline>
<dateline>PENNSAUKEN, N.J. 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>MEDIQ Inc said on Wednesday that its subsidiary, MEDIQ/PRN Life Support Services Inc, has entered a $260 million credit agreement.</p>
<p>Banque Nationale de Paris is the administrative agent and NationsBank N.A. is documentation agent, the company said.</p>
<p>Initial borrowings under the facility were used to pay obligations, including 12 1/8 percent senior secured notes due 1999, the company said.</p>
<p>- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
